## Command

```shell
biome format --write selected.js selected.json other.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "formatter": { "expand": "never" },
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["selected.js", "selected.json"],
      "formatter": { "expand": "whenMultiple" }
    }
  ]
}
```

## `other.js`

```js
const single = { a: 1 };
const multiple = { a: 1, b: 2 };
const array = [1, 2];

```

## `selected.js`

```js
const single = { a: 1 };
const multiple = {
	a: 1,
	b: 2,
};
const array = [
	1,
	2,
];

```

## `selected.json`

```json
{
	"single": { "a": 1 },
	"multiple": {
		"a": 1,
		"b": 2
	},
	"array": [
		1,
		2
	]
}

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
